    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Can you stop the fire before it's too late?</strong> \ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>The Last Fireman,</strong>\u00a0the town is in danger, and only you can save it! Take on the role of a heroic firefighter in this fast-paced <strong>skill-based time attack game</strong> where every second counts. Race against the clock to extinguish the flames before they consume everything in their path!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddef How to Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your fire extinguisher and put out fires before time runs out!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on your extinguisher level\u2014strategic refills are key!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your route carefully and watch out\u2014some objects may explode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer all levels and become the city's ultimate hero!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to stop the fire? \ud83d\udd25\ud83d\ude92</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Can you stop the fire before it's too late?</strong> \ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>The Last Fireman,</strong>\u00a0the town is in danger, and only you can save it! Take on the role of a heroic firefighter in this fast-paced <strong>skill-based time attack game</strong> where every second counts. Race against the clock to extinguish the flames before they consume everything in their path!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddef How to Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your fire extinguisher and put out fires before time runs out!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on your extinguisher level\u2014strategic refills are key!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your route carefully and watch out\u2014some objects may explode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer all levels and become the city's ultimate hero!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to stop the fire? \ud83d\udd25\ud83d\ude92</p>",
    "short_description": "The Last Fireman is a fast-paced time attack game where every second counts! Play as a heroic firefighter, race against the clock, and extinguish the flames before they consume the city. Plan your route, manage your extinguisher, and watch out for explosive obstacles. Can you stop the fire in time?",
